---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | TOYFACTORY">
  <main class="pt-40 pb-32 bg-[#0A0A0F] min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-white mb-16 uppercase italic">Terms of <span class="text-gold">Service.</span></h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-12 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed uppercase tracking-wide text-xs">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">1. MANUFACTURING AGREEMENT</h2>
          <p>BY SUBMITTING AN RFQ OR PLACING AN ORDER, YOU AGREE TO OUR STANDARD MANUFACTURING TERMS. PRODUCTION COMMENCES ONLY UPON RECEIPT OF THE INITIAL DEPOSIT (TYPICALLY 30% T/T).</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">2. SHIPMENT & DELIVERY</h2>
          <p>FOB CHENGHAI/SHANTOU TERMS APPLY UNLESS OTHERWISE NEGOTIATED. TOYFACTORY IS NOT RESPONSIBLE FOR DELAYS CAUSED BY CUSTOMS CLEARANCE OR GLOBAL LOGISTICS CONGESTION POST-DISPATCH.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-6 italic">3. COMPLIANCE</h2>
          <p>ALL PRODUCTS ARE MANUFACTURED TO MEET EN-71, ASTM, AND CE STANDARDS. CUSTOMERS ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR ENSURING SPECIFIC REGIONAL COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS ARE COMMUNICATED DURING THE QUOTATION PHASE.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="pt-12 border-t border-white/10">
          <a href="/" class="text-gold hover:text-white transition-colors font-bold">&larr; BACK TO HOME</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
